# Cursor AI Code Rules - 毛绒定制成本与工期估算系统

## Project Context
- **System Name**: 毛绒定制成本与工期估算系统 (FurZhiZhi / 毛织知)
- **Repo Name**: maorong-cost-estimation
- **Architecture**: Node.js modular design
- **Domain**: Plush Toy Customization Intelligent Quoting & Scheduling System

## Coding Standards & Tags
1. All core modules must include standard annotations:
   - `@Feature`: Linked feature module ID (e.g., M1, M2, M3, M4, M5)
   - `@Version`: Module version (e.g., v0.1.0, v0.2.0, v1.0.0)
   - `@SonarLint`: Quality gate status tag
   - `@AI-Generated`: AI generated code marker with Cursor approval stamp
2. Error Handling & Performance:
   - Quoting engine response time must be strictly < 10s (target < 50ms locally).
   - Cost estimation error margin must be controlled within <= 5%.

## Branch Strategy
- `main`: Production release branch.
- `develop`: Integration & daily baseline scan branch.
- `test`: QA testing branch.
- `feature/*`: Feature development branches.
